{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"加纳","country_iso":"GHA","created_at":"2026-04-10T08:52:09.679813","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"GHA-HB-0005","ldc":"No","location":"库马西","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"加纳库马西3000吨/日垃圾综合处理（发电）项目","project_name_en":"Kumasi 3000 tons/day Waste-to-Energy Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"铁建国际","content":"当地时间9月25日，\n中国铁建国际集团\n签约\n加纳共和国阿克拉、库马西两大城市的垃圾综合处理（发电）项目,\n其中，阿克拉垃圾综合处理（发电）项目是中国企业在加纳签约的最大废固物资源化利用项目，在能源利用领域实现了新突破。\n两大项目位置示意图\n阿克拉垃圾综合处理（发电）项目设计概念图加纳首都阿克拉垃圾综合处理（发电）项目设计日处理生活垃圾3500吨，合同工期40个月；加纳第二大城市库马西垃圾综合处理（发电）项目设计日处理生活垃圾3000吨，合同工期36个月。\n两个项目业主是杰斯坦利-奥乌苏有限公司,\n预计每年可提供绿色电力约13亿千瓦时，烟气排放稳定达到世界领先标准。项目均采用EPC总承包模式。工程主要内容包括项目可行性研究、前期勘察设计、设备供货、项目建造及联合试运转等，两大项目占地面积总计37公顷，包含分拣、堆肥、焚烧发电和办公生活四大功能区。","content_sha256":"564128c4e35be36aa52a8f9a314af43ae5f0a641d9656624f0520c4bba6850ce","id":20345,"publish_date":"2020-09-28 07:40:49","title":"铁建国际签约加纳两大垃圾综合处理(发电)项目","title_sha256":"d40334a6b2bfce1cb103571978b449ebb71e91975bcafdcb293086031c2a7fe3","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/16154.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"GHA-HB-0005","capacity_details":"日处理生活垃圾3000吨，年发电量约13亿千瓦时","capacity_mw":127.83,"capacity_mw_raw":"127.83","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-04-10T08:52:09.684990","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"GHA-HB-0005-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[\"http://njwds.com/content/?376.html\"]","official_website_links":"[]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"杰斯坦利-奥乌苏有限公司","project_developer_en":"Jestinley-Owusu Limited","project_stage"